# Notepad File > Open (COMMDLG): the file type combo dropped with Down (extended interface), All Files
# picked and taken with Enter, the drive combo dropped and closed again. Reference: arch311-ref
# scn/cdlg-types.scn (frame 01 is Notepad before the scenario starts). The dropped lists reach below
# the dialog, so those frames are compared in a box that holds them.
# regress: sh tools/run-fixture-test.sh notepad "$TEST" "$OUT"
# compare: cdlg-types/02.png 01-open.png active ignore 320 240 332 260
# compare: cdlg-types/03.png 02-types.png active ignore 320 240 332 260
# compare: cdlg-types/04.png 03-dropped.png 64 57 536 384 ignore 320 240 332 260
# compare: cdlg-types/05.png 04-allfiles.png 64 57 536 384 ignore 320 240 332 260
# compare: cdlg-types/06.png 05-applied.png active ignore 320 240 332 260
# compare: cdlg-types/07.png 06-drives.png active ignore 320 240 332 260
# compare: cdlg-types/08.png 07-drives-dropped.png 64 57 536 384 ignore 320 240 332 260
# compare: cdlg-types/09.png 08-drives-closed.png active ignore 320 240 332 260
# compare: cdlg-types/10.png 09-closed.png active ignore 316 228 333 261
sleep 400
key alt+f
key o
sleep 400
shotcaret shots/01-open.png
key tab
key tab
key tab
sleep 400
shot shots/02-types.png
key down
sleep 400
shot shots/03-dropped.png
key down
sleep 400
shot shots/04-allfiles.png
key enter
sleep 400
shot shots/05-applied.png
key tab
sleep 400
shot shots/06-drives.png
key down
sleep 400
shot shots/07-drives-dropped.png
key enter
sleep 400
shot shots/08-drives-closed.png
key esc
sleep 400
shotcaret shots/09-closed.png
quit
